<p>Lay a pressure triggered bear trap that snaps onto the first creature passing over it.  Victims are dealt <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">83, 95, 105, 113, 120</acronym> physical damage and become snared (pinned and slowed 30%) and wounded for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">83, 95, 105, 113, 120</acronym> bleeding damage over 5 turns.  Creatures that avoid being snared still suffer bleeding damage.</p>